  "source": {
    "question": "Minimise Z = 2x + 3y over real pairs satisfying x >= 1, y >= 1, x + 2y >= 6, and 2x + y <= 9. Graph the exact feasible region and label every corner with its coordinates and Z value. Mark the complete minimum set. Mark A = (2,2), B = (1,2), C = (1,5/2), and classify feasibility. Do not impose an integer restriction."
  },
